                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "A chronic disease management health care provider sought payments from Medicare and Medicaid for higher, more expensive levels of medical services than those actually performed and for medically unnecessary services.\n\nThanks to the hard work of our Medicaid Fraud Control Unit, we have secured a nearly $600,000 payment to Florida Medicaid for these fraudulent claims.\n\nhttps://t.co/lyCvrbfsUE",
