                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "In recognition of #WorldSuicidePreventionDay, I want to encourage anyone struggling with mental health issues to seek help.\n\nYou can call the Suicide and Crisis Lifeline at 988.\n\nLaw enforcement and first responders can find specialized help statewide by calling the Hope Line, 1(866) 4FL-HERO.\n\nRemember, you don\u2019t have to suffer in silence. Caring people are waiting to hear from you.",
