                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Today, I cast my first vote on a piece of legislation as a U.S. Senator in favor of the Born-Alive Abortion Survivors Protection Act.\n\nOnce again, Democrats blocked the bill\u2019s passage, refusing to acknowledge the humanity of an innocent baby in need of life-saving medical care.\nhttps://t.co/SxVfvHw4Kb",
