                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "During the COVID-19 pandemic, many Americans lost trust in public institutions because of fear mongering and lies.\n\nWe need someone who can restore public trust and deliver tangible solutions on the biggest health priorities for American families.\n\nI'm confident that NIH Director nominee, @DrJBhattacharya, will get it done.",
