                "retweet_count": 18,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Nitazenes pose a greater threat than even fentanyl\u2014these synthetic opioids are more potent, have no medical use, and are often mixed with common street drugs.\n\nAs Florida\u2019s Attorney General, I filed an emergency rule to classify these deadly drugs as Schedule I substances and worked with the state legislature to make classification permanent. It\u2019s far past time for nationwide action.",
