                "text": "Florida is ground zero for health care fraud \u2014 fraud that has contributed to the skyrocketing health care costs for Americans. But, Washington politicians want business as usual. \n\nI came to DC to upend the insanity. it\u2019s time to roll up our sleeves and work on problems rather than blindly shoveling more and more money out the door with no accountability and no solutions.",
